  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[D/C]\n[G]\n[Dsus2]\n[D]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]She's got a smile and it\nseems to me Reminds\n[D/C]me of childhood\nmemories Where e\n[G]verything Was as fresh\nas the bright blue sky\n[D]\n[D]Now and then when I\nsee her face She\n[D/C]takes me away to that\nspecial place And if I'd\n[G]stare too long I'd\nprobably break down and cry\n[D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Asus2]Oh, oh,\n[Cadd9]oh Sweet child o' mine\n[D]\n[Asus2]Oh, oh, oh, oh\n[Cadd9]Sweet love of mine\n[D]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[D]\n[D/C]\n[G]\n[D]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]She's got eyes of the\nbluest skies As\n[D/C]if they thought of rain\nI\n[G]hate to look in-\nto those eyes And\n[D]see an ounce of pain\nHer\n[D]hair reminds me of a\nwarm safe place Where\n[D/C]as a child I'd\nhide And\n[G]pray for the thunder\nAnd the rain To quiet\n[D]ly pass me by\n\n[Chorus]\n[Asus2]Oh, oh,\n[Cadd9]oh Sweet child o' mine\n[D]\n[Asus2]Oh, oh,\n[Cadd9]oh, oh Sweet love\n[D]of mine\n[Asus2]Oh, oh, oh, oh,\n[Cadd9]Sweet child o'\n[D]mine\n[Asus2]Oh, oh,\n[Cadd9]oh, Sweet love of mine\n[D]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[B]\n[Am]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[Bm]\n[Am]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[B]\n[Am]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[B]\n[Am]\n\n[Solo 3]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[F#m/A]\n[Cadd9]  [Dsus2]\n[Em]\n[Cadd9]\n[E7sus2/A]\n[Cadd9]  [Dsus2]\n\n[Solo 4]\n[Em]\n[G]\n[A]\n[Cadd9]  [D]\n\n[Outro 1]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[C]  [D]  [G]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[C]  [D]  [G]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[C]  [D]  [G]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[C]  [D]  [G]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[E5]  [D5]  [B5]  [Bb5]  [A5]  [G5]\n[Em]Where do we go now?\n[G]\n[Am]Where do we go now?\n[C]  [D]  [G]\n\n[Outro 2]\n[Em]",
